,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5-4.5.1\n- Unsure if issue exists in older versions\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 12.7.6 M2 - scons 4.10 - vulkan-sdk-1.4.328 - python 3.14\n\n### Issue description\n\nEven with all (or higher versions) of the required libraries, build tools, and other needed files, Godot can't build from 4.5-4.5.1 source code on macOS 12, specifically one class is failing with an error.\n\nI made a gist (and omitted successfully compiled classes as they took room):\n\n[https://gist.github.com/CreativeMasterBonin/c5496473eecee5b4c7cdcf18bff60787](https://gist.github.com/CreativeMasterBonin/c5496473eecee5b4c7cdcf18bff60787)\n\nThe issue that prevents the compiling from continuing is:\n\n```\nmodules/camera/camera_macos.mm:318:105: error: use of undeclared identifier 'AVCaptureDeviceTypeExternal'\n                        session = [AVCaptureDeviceDiscoverySession discoverySessionWithDeviceTypes:[NSArray arrayWithObjects:AVCaptureDeviceTypeExternal, AVCaptureDeviceTypeBuiltInWideAngleCamera, AVCaptureDeviceTypeContinuityCamera, nil] mediaType:AVMediaTypeVideo position:AVCaptureDevicePositionUnspecified];\n                                                                                                                             ^\nmodules/camera/camera_macos.mm:318:177: error: use of undeclared identifier 'AVCaptureDeviceTypeContinuityCamera'\n                        session = [AVCaptureDeviceDiscoverySession discoverySessionWithDeviceTypes:[NSArray arrayWithObjects:AVCaptureDeviceTypeExternal, AVCaptureDeviceTypeBuiltInWideAngleCamera, AVCaptureDeviceTypeContinuityCamera, nil] mediaType:AVMediaTypeVideo position:AVCaptureDevicePositionUnspecified];\n```\n\nThen scons stops the build process with several errors reported.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe steps to reproduce this issue:\n \n- Download 4.5-4.5.1 Godot source code (zipped or using git).\n- Open Terminal\n- cd to the folder the source is in\n- type scons in Terminal\n- The errors will be printed to the console and Godot will fail to compile and build\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112014/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}